<TEXT>
 
<!-- PJG STAG 4700 -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=80 g=1 f=1 -->
&sect;531.101
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=89 g=1 f=1 -->
Definitions.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=37 g=1 f=1 -->
* * * * *
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Scheduled annual rate of pay 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means_
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) The General Schedule rate of basic pay for the employee's grade and step (or relative position in the rate range),
including a special rate for law enforcement officers under section 403 of the Federal Employees Pay Comparability
Act of 1990 (FEPCA) (Pub. L. 101&hyph;509, 104 Stat. 1465), but exclusive of a special salary rate established under
5 U.S.C. 5305 or similar provision of law (other than section 403 of FEPCA), an 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
adjusted annual rate of pay 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
under this subpart (including a rate continued under &sect;531.106), a 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
special law enforcement adjusted rate of pay 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
under subpart C of this part (including a rate continued under &sect;531.307), a 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
locality rate of pay 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
under subpart F of this part, or additional pay of any kind;
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=37 g=1 f=1 -->
* * * * * 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
3. In &sect;531.103, paragraph (f)(1) is revised to read as follows:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=80 g=1 f=1 -->
&sect;531.103
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=89 g=1 f=1 -->
Administration of adjusted rates of pay.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=37 g=1 f=1 -->
* * * * *
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(f) *&blank;*&blank;*
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) An employee's official duty station is no longer located in an interim geographic adjustment area, except that,
for an employee receiving an adjusted annual rate of pay that is continued under &sect;531.106(a), the continued
rate terminates when the employee is no longer in an area that was an interim geographic adjustment area when the continued
rate first became applicable in January 1994;
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=37 g=1 f=1 -->
* * * * *
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
4. In &sect;531.301, in the definition of 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
