<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 of September 23, 1994, beginning on page 48792, part 708 of the NCUA Regulations was redesignated part 708b. Technical
amendments are necessary to correctly cite the references in part 708b. The regulations are on mergers of federally-insured
credit unions and voluntary termination or conversion of insured status.
