<DOC>
<DOCNO> FR941230-0-00032 </DOCNO>
<PARENT> FR941230-0-00006 </PARENT>
<TEXT>
 
<!-- PJG STAG 4700 -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=94 g=1 f=1 -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=69 g=1 f=1 -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=50 g=1 f=1 -->


<USDEPT>CONSUMER PRODUCT SAFETY COMMISSION</USDEPT>

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=52 g=1 f=1 -->

<CFRNO>16 CFR Part 1210 </CFRNO>
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=55 g=1 f=1 -->
Safety Standard for Cigarette Lighters; Correction 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<AGENCY>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
AGENCY:
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 Consumer Product Safety Commission.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 02 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->
 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
</AGENCY>
<ACTION>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
ACTION:
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 Final rule; correction. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=59 g=1 f=1 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->
</ACTION>
<SUMMARY>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
SUMMARY:
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 This document corrects a citation in a final regulation establishing a safety standard for certain cigarette lighters
that requires the lighters to meet specified criteria so the lighters will resist operation by young children. 16
CFR part 1210. The regulations were published at 58 FR 37554 (July 12, 1993). 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Section 1210.12 of the regulation requires manufacturers (including importers) of lighters subject to the rule
to issue a certificate that the lighters comply with the applicable standard. Section 1210.12(b) contains requirements
for the contents of the certificate of compliance. Section 1210.12(b)(3) states that the certificate shall contain
``*&blank;*&blank;*, if different from the address in paragraph (c)(2) of this section, the address of the place
of manufacture.'' However, paragraph (c)(2) does not contain a requirement for an address, and the reference actually
should be to paragraph (b)(2).
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 02 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
</SUMMARY>
<DATE>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
EFFECTIVE DATE:
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 December 30, 1994.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 02 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
</DATE>
<FURTHER>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
FOR FURTHER INFORMATION CONTACT:
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 Michael Bogumill, Division of Regulatory Management, Consumer Product Safety Commission, Washington, DC 20207&hyph;0001;
telephone (301)504&hyph;0400, ext. 1368. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Accordingly, the Consumer Product Safety Commission amends 16 CFR 1210.12(b)(3) to read as follows: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=80 g=1 f=1 -->
&sect;1210.12 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=89 g=1 f=1 -->
Certificate of compliance. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=37 g=1 f=1 -->
* * * * *
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(b) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Certificate of compliance
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
.&blank;*&blank;*&blank;* 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(3) The date(s) of manufacture and, if different from the address in paragraph (b)(2) of this section, the address
of the place of manufacture.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 04 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->
 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=21 g=1 f=1 -->
Dated: December 23, 1994. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->
</FURTHER>
<SIGNER>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=06 g=1 f=1 -->
Sadye E. Dunn, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->
</SIGNER>
<SIGNJOB>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=04 g=1 f=1 -->
Secretary, Consumer Product Safety Commission. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->
</SIGNJOB>
