<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
14. Section 210.43 is amended by revising the first and last sentences of paragraph (a)(1) and the first sentence of
paragraph (d)(1) to read as follows: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=80 g=1 f=1 -->
&sect;210.43 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=89 g=1 f=1 -->
Petitions for review of initial determinations on matters other than temporary relief. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(a) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Filing of the petition.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 (1) Except as provided in paragraph (a)(2) of this section, any party to an investigation may request Commission review
of an initial determination issued under &sect;210.42(a)(1) or (c), &sect;210.50(d)(3) or &sect;210.70(c) by
filing a petition with the Secretary. *&blank;*&blank;* A petition for review of an initial determination issued
under &sect;210.50(d)(3) or &sect;210.70(c) must be filed within 10 days after issuance of the initial determination.

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

