<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 (1) The Commission shall decide whether to grant, in whole or in part, a petition for review of an initial determination
filed pursuant to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&sect;210.42(a)(1), &sect;210.50(d)(3) or &sect;210.70(c) within 45 days of the service of the initial determination
on the parties, or by such other time as the Commission may order. *&blank;*&blank;* 
