15. Section 210.49 is amended by revising paragraph (a) to read as follows: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=80 g=1 f=1 -->
&sect;210.49 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=89 g=1 f=1 -->
Implementation of Commission action. 
