(1) Red snapper_
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) Effective January 1, 1995 through December 31, 1995_14 inches (35.6 cm) total length for red snapper caught under
the commercial quota specified in &sect;641.25(a); 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

