<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) Effective January 1, 1995 through December 31, 1995_15 inches (38.1 cm) total length for red snapper caught under
the bag limit specified in &sect;641.24(b)(1); 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iii) Effective January 1, 1996, through December 31, 1997_15 inches (38.1 cm) total length; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

