(b) *&blank;*&blank;* 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) Red snapper_5. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=37 g=1 f=3 -->
* * * * * 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
6. A new &sect;641.30 is added, effective from January 1, 1995, through February 23, 1995, to read as follows: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=80 g=1 f=3 -->
&sect;641.30
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=89 g=1 f=3 -->
Closure of the commercial fishery for red snapper. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Other provisions of this part 641 notwithstanding, the commercial fishery for red snapper is closed from January
1, 1995, through February 23, 1995. During this closure of the commercial fishery, red snapper harvested from or possessed
in the EEZ, and each vessel for which a currently valid reef fish permit has been issued pursuant to &sect;641.4, is
subject to the following: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(a) The bag and possession limits, as specified in &sect;641.24 (b)(1) and (c); and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(b) The prohibition of purchase, barter, trade, or sale of red snapper taken under the bag limit, or attempted purchase,
barter, trade, or sale of such red snapper, as specified in &sect;641.24(g). 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 03 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

