17 CFR 230.418(b) and 17 CFR 240.12b&hyph;4, respectively. These rules permit the return of supplemental information
where the request for the return of the information is made at the time of submission and where such return is consistent
with the protection of investors and with the provisions of the Freedom of Information Act [5 U.S.C. 552]. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
</FOOTNOTE>

