<!-- PJG ITAG l=28 g=1 f=1 -->
 discussion of revised Rule 311(b) of Regulation S&hyph;T, below, for treatment of exhibits to schedules filed pursuant
to Section 13 or 14(d) of the Exchange Act [15 U.S.C. 78(m) or (n)(d), respectively]. In addition, registered investment
companies and business development companies are directed to the requirements of Rule 102(e) [17 CFR 232.102(e)].

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

