Revision of note to Item 601(c)(1) of Regulations S&hyph;K and S&hyph;B. This is a revision to the note adopted in connection
with the implementation of Financial Data Schedules, which indicates that no Financial Data Schedule is required
for Form 11&hyph;K. 
