<FOOTCITE>96</FOOTCITE>
 has been amended to make it clear that a Financial Data Schedule is required only upon the filing of an amendment to a
registration statement on that form. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<FOOTNOTE>
