<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=83 g=1 f=1 -->
D. Changes to Public Utility Act Rules and Forms 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
The following amendments to the Public Utility Act Rules and Forms have been adopted as proposed: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&bull;Forms U5B,
<FOOTCITE>97</FOOTCITE>
 U5S,
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=1 -->
98
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 and U&hyph;1
<FOOTCITE>99</FOOTCITE>
 under the Public Utility Act have been amended to state that if an instrument defining the rights of security holders
is in the form of a certificate, the text appearing on the certificate must be reproduced in an electronic filing.
<FOOTCITE>100</FOOTCITE>
 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

