<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(c) The first electronic amendment to a paper format Schedule 13D (&sect;240.13d&hyph;101) or Schedule 13G (&sect;240.13d&hyph;102)
shall restate the entire text of the Schedule 13D or Schedule 13G, but previously filed paper exhibits to such Schedules
are not required to be restated electronically. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
See
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 Rule 102 of Regulation S&hyph;T (&sect;232.102 of this chapter) regarding amendments to exhibits filed in electronic
format. 
