all domestic registrants and adopted minor amendments to the EDGAR rules. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
</FOOTNOTE>

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Paper copies of the updated Filer Manual may be obtained at the following address: Public Reference Room, U.S. Securities
and Exchange Commission, Mail Stop 1&hyph;2, 450 Fifth Street NW., Washington DC 20549. Electronic format copies
will be available on the EDGAR electronic bulletin board. Copies also may be obtained from Disclosure Incorporated,
the paper and microfiche contractor for the Commission, at (800) 638&hyph;8241. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Since the Filer Manual relates solely to agency procedure or practice, publication for notice and comment is not required
under the Administrative Procedure Act.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=1 -->
4
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 It follows that the requirements of the Regulatory Flexibility Act
