<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
FOR FURTHER INFORMATION CONTACT:
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 Dr. Jeffrey L. Gilmore or Dr. Wm. Jay Jackman, Higher Education Programs/CSREES, U.S. Department of Agriculture,
at (202) 401&hyph;1790.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 02 -->
